======== 2  fitness gate 3, the unsafe-posture limb, per candidate ========
Method: for each extracted crate, /usr/bin/grep -n -w 'unsafe' over every .rs
file found by find(1) under the crate's own src/ (and, for nutype, its whole
tree, whose only .rs file is src/lib.rs). The count is of MATCHING LINES over
the WHOLE tree, never a head-truncated prefix. Every matching line is printed
below the count, so the count can be audited against the listing.

Scope note that goes with every row: R06 (research/topics/06-unsafe-code-policy)
forbids unsafe in the TEMPLATE'S OWN code via [workspace.lints.rust]
unsafe_code = "forbid" and makes no claim about the dependency tree, because
Cargo compiles dependencies with --cap-lints allow. So no row below excludes a
candidate; gate 3's unsafe limb is a STATED POSTURE, not a filter.

